<blockquote>
<p>1. Similarities between SCP-2955 and SCP-2583 have been noted. Investigation into a potential shared origin is ongoing.</p>
</blockquote>
<p>While I agree that the similarities noted are within reason, I do not necessarily agree with implying a shared origin (whether if it can be applicable or not).</p>
<p>Thus, my proposed solution to this is:</p>
<blockquote>
<p>1. Similarities between SCP-2955 and SCP-2583 have been noted. [DATA REDACTED]</p>
</blockquote>
<p>This might seem to be a cop-out, but I think it would leave room for readers to fill in the blank, I hope.</p>

